WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.558
RUFUS: Those are Anthropic's numbers. On
Anthropic's benchmark.

00:00:03.771 --> 00:00:07.964
JAMIE: Yes. But even discounting for
that, sixty to eighty-six is a gap

00:00:07.964 --> 00:00:12.157
JAMIE: that would take a very flattering
methodology to explain away entirely.

00:00:12.222 --> 00:00:13.993
ALEX: What else changed besides the
price?

00:00:14.078 --> 00:00:18.721
JAMIE: Zero data retention by default
through the API. And there are what

00:00:18.721 --> 00:00:23.363
JAMIE: Anthropic calls preserved-
thinking anti-distillation protections —
that applies to API accounts created

00:00:23.363 --> 00:00:28.006
JAMIE: on or after August thirty-first.
Which means competitors can't as easily
train

00:00:28.006 --> 00:00:32.649
JAMIE: on Opus 5.5's reasoning traces.
